1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,000
Okay. Sunday morning, and the town is still asleep.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,600
First stop: um, coffee from the little cart by the bridge.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,600
Then we walked down to the market.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,000
The boats come in around now, and it gets loud, fast.

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,600
This is my favourite hour here.

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,000
Same time tomorrow? Follow along.
